An attribute name admits no colon

```
[a]{xlink:href=u}

[b]{k:v="q"}

[c]{.sm:hover}

[d]{#a:b}

[e]{.ok xml:lang=en}
.
<p>[a]{xlink:href=u}</p>
<p>[b]{k:v=“q”}</p>
<p>[c]{.sm:hover}</p>
<p>[d]{<span class="tag"><strong>#a</strong></span>:b}</p>
<p>[e]{.ok xml:lang=en}</p>
```

```
[a]{k=x:y}

[b]{#i .c k=v}

| a | b |{.x}
.
<p><span k="x:y">a</span></p>
<p><span id="i" class="c" k="v">b</span></p>
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr class="x"><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```

```
| a | b |{.a:b}

-{.a:b} item
.
<p>| a | b |{.a:b}</p>
<p>-{.a:b} item</p>
```
